55
00:03:04,150 --> 00:03:07,000
Instead of just saying something vague, you get super specific.

56
00:03:07,140 --> 00:03:12,670
You describe the situation, you detail the exact behavior you saw, and then you explain the impact it had.

57
00:03:12,990 --> 00:03:19,680
This keeps feedback totally objective and actionable, and it takes all that personal judgment out of the equation, which is absolutely key for building trust.

58
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:20,860
