111
00:06:15,750 --> 00:06:23,260
You list out the potential risks, you design a response for each one, and you create a communication plan so no one's ever left in the dark.

112
00:06:23,250 --> 00:06:28,650
When you do this, setbacks just become temporary detours, not career-derailing disasters.

113
00:06:29,130 --> 00:06:31,560
And finally, please, please don't forget this one.

114
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:35,880
In the middle of all the planning and all the hard work, you have to celebrate.

115
00:06:36,460 --> 00:06:38,610
Celebration isn't a luxury, it's fuel.

116
00:06:39,020 --> 00:06:48,260
Recognizing the wins, both the big ones and the small ones, boosts morale, reinforces the right behaviors, and reminds everybody why they're working so hard in the first place.

117
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:51,120
